caption: Mastery Requirements
tradition-component: mastery-requirements

To master Dreadhound, satisfy all of the following:

Raise Will to 20.

Raise the chosen Dreadhound Path Talent to 4.

Acquire at least six distinct Psychic Patterns through consequential investigation or conflict.

Use at least four different Patterns as Current Prey during consequential play.

Successfully use at least three materially different loaded negation configurations during consequential play.

Consequentially use at least one Gift-derived Super-Memorization configuration without relying on a Current Prey or Prey Repository.

Consequentially use at least one permanent Hunter trait limited to Current Prey.

Consequentially use the chosen Path Power as part of a hunt, confrontation, capture, escape, or kill.

Invest at least 100 character points total in traits purchased through Dreadhound, measured after modifiers. Attributes and Talents do not count toward this investment.

Complete a consequential deed in which acquiring a prey sample, configuring a countermeasure from it, and exploiting that countermeasure materially changes the outcome against the Current Prey.
